  "overview": {
    "splashTitle": "Bring the power of AI agents to business processes",
    "splashDescription": "AI agents are powerful, but without orchestration, they lack the coordination, accountability, and reliability needed for real-world, business-critical processes. Camunda orchestrates AI agents, ensures their work is transparent, and provides the reliability your customers are looking for. This connector makes it easy to add agents to processes and leverage advanced AI capabilities for complex automation use cases. Enhance processes with AI-powered decision-making, content generation, and intelligent task execution, all while using your AI service provider of choice.",
    "imageUrl": "https://d3bql97l1ytoxn.cloudfront.net/app_resources/522488/overview/img3413129807889304746.png?22b4f0345003c023b77704d70499d4eb",
